rtise in VFX is unmatched. For 30 years, he has operated at the intersection of art and science, driving the last major technological shift in filmmaking with CGI,” said Prem Ak	https://stability.ai/news-updates/introducing-our-new-chief-pipeline-architect-rob-legato
